### f. Term and Termination

The term of this Agreement will commence upon Your acceptance of this Agreement or access to the Fish Audio Materials and will continue in full force and effect until terminated in accordance with the terms and conditions herein. Fish Audio may terminate this Agreement by written notice to You if You breach any term or condition of this Agreement and, if the breach is capable of cure, You do not cure it within thirty (30) days after Fish Audio's written notice describing the breach. If You breach Section IV(b), this Agreement and all licenses granted to You under it terminate automatically, without notice or cure period. Upon termination of this Agreement, You shall delete and cease use of any Fish Audio Materials or Derivative Works. Sections IV(b) (as it applies to any output or results of the Fish Audio Materials or Derivative Works that You retain), IV(c)(iii), IV(c)(iv), IV(c)(v), IV(d), IV(e), IV(g) and V shall survive the termination of this Agreement.

